[*]
[*] Accumulate waveform layout (issue #66): the last two chunks of the tiled
[*] product chunks (4x40x4, tiled product 2), run as chunks of 16, 16 and 8.
[*] Both runs shown start with accumulate high, so they go from DONE straight to
[*] COMPUTE with no CLEAR, and PE (0,0) keeps adding onto its partial sum.
[*] From the repository root:
[*]   make sim-systolic_top
[*]   gtkwave -r sim/waves/report.gtkwaverc sim/waves/systolic_top_accumulate.gtkw
[*] state: 0 IDLE, 1 CLEAR, 2 COMPUTE, 3 CAPTURE, 4 DONE.
[*] Markers: A second chunk starts (k_len 16), B its done (cycle_count 23),
[*] C third chunk starts (k_len 8), D its done (cycle_count 15, C[0][0] final).
[*]
